  "details": "I have a quest pro with face tracking. A friend (who also has a quest pro) on open beta build 1744 pointed out that my eyes are darting around randomly, jiggling and not moving properly anymore. My avatar's eye movements and blinking look perfectly fine locally. Proper \"face tracking\" avatars' eyes still look fine both locally and remotely.  When he uses one with eye look eye tracking I see the eyes jiggle strangely instead of tracking his eyes, while he reports they look fine locally on his end.  Before 1744, it worked perfectly locally and remotely.",
